@startuml
title UC-18 - Xoa Application (MS-01..09)
autonumber
actor "Developer / PE / Admin" as User
boundary "Settings - vung nguy hiem" as UI
boundary ApplicationDeletionController as API
control ApplicationDeletionPlanner as Planner
control ApplicationDeletionService as Service
database "Application / Environments / instances / refs" as Records
control WorkloadRemoval as Workloads
control ResourceCleanupService as Cleanup
control SecretPurger as Secrets
User -> UI: Xoa ung dung
UI -> API: POST deletion-preview
API -> API: Session Organization + role
API -> Planner: Prepare(application)
Planner -> Records: One snapshot: versions, Sets, drafts, instances (all generations), inventories, Vault refs
Planner -> Planner: Classify delete / keep / blockers [MS-01]
Planner --> UI: token, scope per Environment, kept items, blockers [MS-02]
UI -> User: Permanent data-loss warning; type Application name [MS-03]
User -> UI: Confirm
UI -> API: POST deletions(token, confirmationName)
API -> Service: Delete
Service -> Records: Reload scope; check token/name/versions/blockers [MS-04]
alt stale / busy / blocker / wrong name
  Service --> UI: 409 safe error; no side effects
else admitted
  Service -> Records: CAS Application version -> DELETING + progress
  Service --> UI: 202 operationId
  loop each Environment in key order, each stage under its own owner/fence
    Service -> Workloads: Empty candidate Set, DEPLOY claim (UC-07 VAR-02) [MS-05]
    Workloads --> Service: objects removed / REMOVE Deployment
    Service -> Cleanup: Admit whole generation, RESOURCE_CLEANUP claim, reverse graph [MS-06]
    Cleanup --> Service: per-instance result
    Service -> Cleanup: Verify absence [MS-07]
    Cleanup --> Service: DESTROYED or remaining IDs
    Service -> Secrets: Delete exact Vault refs [MS-08]
    Secrets --> Service: deleted / store error
    Service -> Records: Persist stage + results
  end
  UI -> API: Poll operation
  API -> Records: Read persisted stages (no provider call)
  alt both Environments SUCCEEDED
    Service -> Records: CAS Application -> DELETED [MS-09]
    Records --> UI: Deleted; return to Applications list
  else any stage FAILED or INTERRUPTED
    Records --> UI: DELETING; stage + remaining IDs; Retry
  end
end
note over User, Secrets
No rollback or undo. PREEXISTING clusters, Connections,
Secret Stores and catalog are never deleted.
end note
@enduml
